# Commons Module

This directory contains shared utilities and common functionality used across the diNo library, providing essential services for data handling, parameter management, and testing utilities.

## Components

### Data Loading System (`dataloaders.hpp/cpp`)

Provides comprehensive data loading capabilities for time series datasets:

#### Core Functions

- **`loadBinData()`**: Loads time series data from binary files

- **`loadRandomData()`**: Generates synthetic time series data (automatically z-normalized)

